---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-16 border-t border-line/70 py-10 text-sm text-muted">
  <div class="container-page flex flex-col gap-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between">
    <div class="max-w-sm">
      <p class="font-semibold text-ink">Vanishnote</p>
      <p class="mt-1">
        Notes are encrypted in your browser. We store scrambled data we cannot read, then delete it.
      </p>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Footer">
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-10 gap-y-2">
        <li><a class="hover:text-accent" href="/how-it-works">How it works</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-accent" href="/privacy">Privacy</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-accent" href="/security">Security</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-accent" href="/terms">Terms</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-accent" href="/faq">FAQ</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-accent" href="/blog">Blog</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-accent" href="/extension">Browser extension</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </div>
  <div class="container-page mt-8">
    <p>&copy; {year} Vanishnote. No ads. Nothing tracks you where notes are written or read.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
